# (docs/research/double-battles.md §6.3): Eterna Forest with Cheryl.
# A constructed system replay, labelled as such: a CP5-like party set up here (not the story chain; cp6 replays it
# in order). Cheryl's coord event at 28, 85 (EternaForest_CoordEvent_CherylStartFollowing) sets
# VAR_PARTNER_TRAINER_ID and the has-partner flag; she follows. In the grass a wild encounter rolls two slots and
# battles with her (decomp TryGenerateGrassEncounter_DoubleBattle: BATTLE_TYPE_AI_PARTNER, 74; the party is healed
# after it, Party_HealAllMembers). Then Bug Catcher Jack (37, 67, facing right) and Lass Briana (40, 67, facing
# left) both see the player at 38, 67: APPROACH_TYPE_VS2, and the common script's StartTrainerBattle takes the
# walking partner (decomp TRAINER_WITH_AI_PARTNER, 75). Runs headless in tests/integration/m5-doubles.rom.test.ts.
party 0 platinum:SPECIES_STARAVIA 22
party 1 platinum:SPECIES_MONFERNO 22
set flag platinum:FLAG_HIDE_ETERNA_FOREST_CHERYL false
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_ETERNA_FOREST 28 84 down
until idle
+0 press down
until position 28 85
+0 release down
advance text 3000
until idle 3000
+0 assert state hasPartner true
# north past the signboard to the grass at x 32
+0 press up
until position 28 83
+0 release up
+0 press right
until position 32 83
+0 release right
+0 press up
until battle 3000
+0 release up
battle auto 30000
+0 assert battle wild * won ai-partner
until idle 3000
# Jack and Briana: east along row 75, then up the x 38 path to row 67, where both see the player
+0 press right
until position 38 75
+0 release right
+0 press up
until position 38 67
+0 release up
advance text 3000
battle auto 30000
+0 assert battle trainer platinum:TRAINER_BUG_CATCHER_JACK won ai-partner
+0 assert battle trainer platinum:TRAINER_LASS_BRIANA won ai-partner
advance text 3000
until idle 3000
+0 assert state hasPartner true
# Healed after the win while Cheryl walks along (Staravia was paralyzed in the battle).
+0 assert state party[0].status "none"
+0 assert state party[0].hp 58
